<p>Condenses ambient water on a target, freezing it for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns and damaging it for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">184, 248, 298, 340, 377.</acronym></p><p>If this is used on a friendly target the cooldown is reduced by 33%.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>